{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>天文台在下午4時45分發出特別天氣提示：一股東北季候風會在明早（24日）影響廣東沿岸，預料本港會轉吹偏北強風，天氣逐步轉涼，有幾陣雨，初時雨勢較為頻密。周三（25日）及周四（26日）早晚清涼，市區最低氣溫在16°C左右，新界再低兩三度。市民請留意天氣變化，注意保暖。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.241481+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:48:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T00:57:11.067381+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:23.606545+00:00","content_hash":"de01db956d6357b2b1238c11bf94459692d0616193d66d7e1ef46e9c0fbcc51f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}